# KNITRO options for the Melitz Delta_profile(g) = min_eta Delta(g,eta) nuisance-minimization
# outer NLP (Stage 2, 2026-07-24 outer-benchmark-correction session,
# src/melitz/nuisance_profile.jl). Modeled directly on melitz_outer_finite_delta.opt (same
# algorithm/eval_fcga/hessopt/feastol/opttol rationale -- the objective gradient here comes
# from the SAME direct fixed-dual backend, now evaluated at a genuinely converged optimal
# dual since this problem has no divergence-budget constraint to reject against) but with a
# larger default maxit: a real minimization over the nuisance coordinates may need more
# outer iterations than the finite-delta search's own budget-rejection-dominated trajectory.
algorithm       0
eval_fcga       no
gradopt         exact
hessopt         2
feastol         1e-7
feastol_abs     1e-8
opttol          1e-3
opttol_abs      1e-4
maxit           8
outlev          3
honorbnds       always

maxtime_real    60
